WEBVTT

00:00:23.876 --> 00:00:26.756
♪ When this moment come to us ♪

00:00:26.897 --> 00:00:29.266
♪ The Stars will always shine ♪
[Full-Time Magister 3]

00:00:29.681 --> 00:00:33.521
♪ The light travels through
the horizon to you ♪

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:35.893
♪ Right now light it up
follow your heart, yeah ♪

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:48.646
♪ Our dream of madness is rattling ♪

00:00:48.647 --> 00:00:50.642
♪ Just cause you feel it possible ♪

00:00:50.694 --> 00:00:55.188
♪ My eyes will open wide
in this cold, dark night ♪

00:00:55.769 --> 00:00:58.405
♪ The heart bound by time
is just a shackle ♪

00:00:58.406 --> 00:01:00.556
♪ You said that dreams will never fall ♪

00:01:00.557 --> 00:01:03.815
♪ You put on the wings for me ♪

00:01:03.845 --> 00:01:07.977
♪ Braving through the wind ♪

00:01:09.512 --> 00:01:12.296
♪ When this moment comes to us ♪

00:01:12.308 --> 00:01:14.608
♪ My heart will no longer be lost ♪

00:01:15.185 --> 00:01:19.322
♪ I carry the weight of stars
and moon as I search for you ♪

00:01:19.348 --> 00:01:21.748
♪ You summon me from the dream ♪

00:01:21.749 --> 00:01:24.797
♪ My ambition is burning on ♪

00:01:24.798 --> 00:01:27.421
♪ You are the hope of light
in my darkest night ♪

00:01:27.422 --> 00:01:29.016
♪ On the other end of shine ♪

00:01:29.017 --> 00:01:31.535
♪ Let it all out and fight ♪

00:01:31.536 --> 00:01:34.657
♪ Shine bright like
it's the end of the world ♪

00:01:34.735 --> 00:01:37.203
♪ The Stars is burning through the sky ♪

00:01:37.217 --> 00:01:39.087
♪ Your hands are now ♪

00:01:39.088 --> 00:01:40.621
♪ Burning ♪

00:01:40.969 --> 00:01:44.660
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:49.873
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:50.727 --> 00:01:53.341
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:02:00.645 --> 00:02:01.499
Sister Mu.

00:02:01.587 --> 00:02:04.119
I've found a house.
Let's check it out later.

00:02:05.779 --> 00:02:07.699
Because of what happened in the stadium,

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:10.375
my family almost forbid me
to rent outside with you guys.

00:02:10.662 --> 00:02:12.076
It's better to be careful.

00:02:12.229 --> 00:02:15.569
I can't believe that he's the one
that killed the Scaly Queen.

00:02:16.541 --> 00:02:18.141
Can Light Magic deal with such damage?

00:02:18.667 --> 00:02:21.042
Maybe it's because of
his noble background.

00:02:21.159 --> 00:02:22.865
And he killed it because
he has many Magic Tools.

00:02:23.344 --> 00:02:25.555
Anyway, he's our hero now.

00:02:25.556 --> 00:02:27.265
He's very handsome too.

00:02:27.793 --> 00:02:29.170
There's another rumour too.

00:02:29.437 --> 00:02:32.087
They said that Mo Fan
was the one who did this.

00:02:35.994 --> 00:02:38.438
This will be the biggest
Awards Ceremony ever.

00:02:38.441 --> 00:02:39.485
Yeah!

00:02:39.486 --> 00:02:41.673
Two students had saved
thousands of lives!

00:02:41.752 --> 00:02:42.886
They're amazing.

00:02:43.697 --> 00:02:45.186
I believe in Zhao Man Yan.

00:02:45.428 --> 00:02:48.784
But I couldn't believe that Mo Fan
is the one helping him.

00:02:48.839 --> 00:02:50.198
That was unexpected.

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:51.413
By the way,

00:02:51.493 --> 00:02:53.222
I know the situation was chaotic,

00:02:53.223 --> 00:02:57.161
but I saw a Starchart-level
Thunder Magic that day.

00:02:57.162 --> 00:02:58.980
And he killed the Scaly Queen.

00:03:00.834 --> 00:03:04.725
Maybe Zhao Man Yan
is a Thunder Mage too.

00:03:05.032 --> 00:03:07.076
He's so cool!

00:03:08.191 --> 00:03:09.658
So that's Mo Fan.

00:03:09.814 --> 00:03:11.042
What did you say?

00:03:11.319 --> 00:03:12.297
Nothing!

00:03:12.899 --> 00:03:14.003
It's nothing.

00:03:20.028 --> 00:03:23.473
You two are like celebrities now.

00:03:24.747 --> 00:03:27.358
But one of you is not
accepted by the public.

00:03:27.359 --> 00:03:29.089
And one of you is not
trusted by the public.

00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:32.828
Never mind.

00:03:33.077 --> 00:03:34.898
He wants the money and I want the fame.

00:03:34.899 --> 00:03:35.978
And we've achieved our goals.

00:03:40.032 --> 00:03:41.075
What do you mean?

00:03:45.332 --> 00:03:46.909
Where's my Thunder Seed?

00:03:47.789 --> 00:03:50.455
You know the Soul Thunder Seed
is limited in stock, right?

00:03:50.456 --> 00:03:52.646
I will go and participate
in Sunday's auction.

00:03:53.176 --> 00:03:55.441
They will auction
a Soul Thunder Seed there.

00:03:55.762 --> 00:03:56.807
Let's go together.

00:03:56.895 --> 00:03:59.186
I'll give it to you right away
after I bought it.

00:04:00.292 --> 00:04:03.006
Auction? I'm sure it's
full of quality items.

00:04:04.599 --> 00:04:06.785
Yeah. You can buy...

00:04:06.792 --> 00:04:08.917
or sell anything there.

00:04:15.642 --> 00:04:16.442
Sure.

00:04:16.486 --> 00:04:17.663
Bring me along.

00:04:19.389 --> 00:04:22.722
Items that mages use
are always limited in numbers.

00:04:23.898 --> 00:04:27.945
The resources found in the barrier
area are monopolized by big shots.

00:04:28.562 --> 00:04:33.495
This is the reason why everyone
is trying to get into big companies.

00:04:35.637 --> 00:04:37.326
I'm really impressed by you.

00:04:38.036 --> 00:04:41.320
You can get to this level even when
you're from a humble background.

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:46.020
By the way, I need to sell something.

00:04:46.931 --> 00:04:48.109
What are you selling?

00:04:49.283 --> 00:04:50.683
Warrior-level Spirit Essence.

00:04:51.954 --> 00:04:54.043
How did you get so lucky?

00:04:54.177 --> 00:04:56.207
You even got
the Warrior-level Spirit Essence?

00:04:56.915 --> 00:04:58.226
Did you get this from the Scaly Queen?

00:04:59.865 --> 00:05:01.110
I didn't expect it either.

00:05:01.788 --> 00:05:03.099
I'm impressed again.

00:05:03.616 --> 00:05:07.640
It's a rare drop from
Warrior-level monsters.

00:05:09.497 --> 00:05:10.652
But,

00:05:11.788 --> 00:05:14.055
how did you get the Soul Container?

00:05:15.629 --> 00:05:17.318
Soul Container?

00:05:17.882 --> 00:05:18.682
Yeah.

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:19.965
Without it,

00:05:20.023 --> 00:05:21.268
you can't collect Spirit Essence.

00:05:21.734 --> 00:05:23.889
Your Soul Container can collect
Warrior-level Spirit Essence.

00:05:24.338 --> 00:05:27.049
It's at least worth 20 million yuan.

00:05:28.492 --> 00:05:30.693
This container is that expensive?

00:05:31.328 --> 00:05:32.350
Brother.

00:05:32.861 --> 00:05:36.199
Only the Soul Mages can collect
Spirit Essence, you know?

00:05:36.943 --> 00:05:39.041
But now, someone has invented
Soul Containers.

00:05:39.096 --> 00:05:40.487
Of course it's super expensive.

00:05:41.024 --> 00:05:43.797
Let's go! I'll help you
sell your Spirit Essence.

00:05:43.863 --> 00:05:45.186
I'm sure it can fetch a good price!

00:05:51.046 --> 00:05:51.859
Catfish.

00:05:51.966 --> 00:05:53.295
I didn't know that you are so capable.

00:05:53.662 --> 00:05:56.172
I'm really curious where you come from.

00:06:02.204 --> 00:06:04.706
The starting price is at
10 million yuan?

00:06:05.309 --> 00:06:06.349
I've appraised it for you.

00:06:06.783 --> 00:06:08.912
The Spirit Essence
of Scaly Queen is unique.

00:06:09.225 --> 00:06:10.499
It's worth at least 20 million yuan.

00:06:11.049 --> 00:06:12.889
Do you think you belong here?

00:06:14.768 --> 00:06:15.767
It's you again.

00:06:18.983 --> 00:06:19.890
Who are you?

00:06:22.529 --> 00:06:23.603
Stop laughing!

00:06:24.426 --> 00:06:25.588
I'm Bai Cangfeng.

00:06:25.589 --> 00:06:26.588
Bai Cangfeng!

00:06:26.648 --> 00:06:27.647
Now you know who I am!

00:06:27.758 --> 00:06:30.598
I'm the eldest son of
The Bai Family in Mingzhu City!

00:06:32.363 --> 00:06:33.319
Listen.

00:06:33.607 --> 00:06:35.209
If you didn't resort
to your tricks that day,

00:06:35.413 --> 00:06:37.719
you would've been dead by now.

00:06:39.722 --> 00:06:41.669
Who is this Bai Cangfeng?

00:06:42.363 --> 00:06:45.692
He pissed himself by your Lightning Bolt in the Battle of Beasts.

00:06:46.143 --> 00:06:48.002
Oh, it's him?

00:06:48.599 --> 00:06:50.902
He went down too quickly.
I never got to see his face.

00:06:56.858 --> 00:06:58.126
28 million!

00:06:58.179 --> 00:07:00.546
That mister has bought it successfully!

00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:01.930
Thank you.

00:07:01.956 --> 00:07:03.358
I'll take it now.

00:07:03.928 --> 00:07:08.759
The Thunder Seed is obtained from
a mountain under the thunderstorm.

00:07:08.823 --> 00:07:10.223
It's known as Thousand Volt.

00:07:10.576 --> 00:07:12.497
Thousand Volt can create
extremely strong impacts.

00:07:12.562 --> 00:07:17.099
It's way more powerful than
the normal Thunder Seeds.

00:07:17.888 --> 00:07:18.688
Nice.

00:07:18.834 --> 00:07:21.471
My Thunder Magic will be
the same as my Fire Magic now.

00:07:21.472 --> 00:07:22.995
It's improved now.

00:07:23.487 --> 00:07:25.279
Because of this Thousand Volt.

00:07:26.205 --> 00:07:29.994
I'm sure everyone will be interested
in the next item as well.

00:07:30.214 --> 00:07:32.246
This is the egg of
a Blue-Feathered Giant Peacock.

00:07:32.332 --> 00:07:35.192
The Blue-Feathered Giant Peacock
has the blood of Peng Lai Peacock.

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:38.413
Everyone, please wait.

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:39.996
There's an extra item here.

00:07:40.829 --> 00:07:42.021
What?

00:07:42.095 --> 00:07:44.478
Why is he changing the order?

00:07:45.054 --> 00:07:46.521
Everyone, calm down.

00:07:46.594 --> 00:07:49.494
I believe you will need the next item.

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:55.333
This is the Spirit Essence
of a Warrior-level monster.

00:07:56.174 --> 00:07:58.174
It's collected from
the Parasitic Monsters.

00:08:01.302 --> 00:08:02.355
It's your turn now.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:06.631
I believe I don't need to
introduce this item.

00:08:06.849 --> 00:08:09.229
The starting price is
at 12 million yuan.

00:08:09.411 --> 00:08:11.171
If you collect any other
Spirit Essences next time,

00:08:11.592 --> 00:08:13.605
you can contact
that appraiser right away.

00:08:14.232 --> 00:08:16.667
He's from the Zhao family.
He won't give you an unfair price.

00:08:18.983 --> 00:08:20.077
15 million!

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:21.340
17 million!

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:22.379
20 million!

00:08:23.011 --> 00:08:24.338
29 million!

00:08:24.365 --> 00:08:26.174
29 million, one.

00:08:26.803 --> 00:08:28.713
29 million, two.

00:08:29.069 --> 00:08:31.082
29 million, three.

00:08:31.378 --> 00:08:32.711
Deal!

00:08:34.488 --> 00:08:36.248
The buyer is someone
from The Bai Family!

00:08:43.324 --> 00:08:47.111
People like you have no chance
to get items like this.

00:08:47.932 --> 00:08:49.159
Yes.

00:08:50.879 --> 00:08:53.083
Next item is an Offensive Magic Tool.

00:08:53.304 --> 00:08:54.304
The Shield of Hell.

00:08:54.662 --> 00:08:59.907
Besides easily blocking the attacks
of Warrior-level monsters,

00:09:00.154 --> 00:09:06.516
the shield itself can produce spikes
too, thus piercing the enemies.

00:09:07.016 --> 00:09:08.349
I want this!

00:09:10.016 --> 00:09:11.683
Since you're rich now,

00:09:12.319 --> 00:09:13.573
you can bid for it.

00:09:20.147 --> 00:09:22.632
You've kept your promise.
The Thunder Seed is of good quality.

00:09:22.686 --> 00:09:23.579
Thank you!

00:09:24.259 --> 00:09:26.264
No problem. We're brothers, right?

00:09:27.074 --> 00:09:28.380
You have both money and Magic Tools now.

00:09:28.699 --> 00:09:29.739
What do you plan to do next?

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:33.417
Although I have the money, I need
to spend way more than what I have.

00:09:33.907 --> 00:09:37.313
I will rent a house outside.
Only then, I can focus on my training.

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:40.547
It's okay if you have decided.

00:09:41.722 --> 00:09:43.282
I wish we have a smooth semester!

00:09:43.662 --> 00:09:46.624
I wish you can find
a beautiful housemate too.

00:09:50.424 --> 00:09:53.259
[Convenience Store]

00:09:58.258 --> 00:09:59.258
You're here?

00:09:59.963 --> 00:10:00.536
Yes.

00:10:00.656 --> 00:10:02.749
I've read online that this place is renting.

00:10:04.114 --> 00:10:04.901
Hello.

00:10:10.986 --> 00:10:11.666
Excuse me.

00:10:13.852 --> 00:10:14.852
It's you?

00:10:16.225 --> 00:10:18.491
What a coincidence!
Are you here for the house too?

00:10:21.215 --> 00:10:22.722
You look familiar.

00:10:24.937 --> 00:10:26.112
Are you the devil?

00:10:26.961 --> 00:10:29.107
Devil?

00:10:35.086 --> 00:10:35.886
I'll stay here then!

00:10:36.726 --> 00:10:37.766
Ladies,

00:10:37.767 --> 00:10:38.766
how about it?

00:10:39.355 --> 00:10:40.569
I love this place!

00:10:40.649 --> 00:10:42.382
Sister Mu, let's stay here!

00:10:43.567 --> 00:10:44.260
Okay.

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:46.870
You guys can share this house
as you all like it.

00:10:47.281 --> 00:10:49.201
My house is quite expensive.

00:10:49.588 --> 00:10:51.628
You'll spend much if you stay alone.

00:10:54.229 --> 00:10:56.589
I'm not used to share a house
with someone else.

00:10:56.939 --> 00:10:59.012
Sister Mu, I didn't share a house
with anyone else before.

00:10:59.126 --> 00:11:01.615
In the novels, many university
students share a house.

00:11:01.616 --> 00:11:02.615
This must be fun!

00:11:03.562 --> 00:11:05.287
Xiaotu, don't simply say that.

00:11:05.288 --> 00:11:06.406
We are not familiar with him.

00:11:07.339 --> 00:11:09.015
Sister Mu, it will be fine.

00:11:09.016 --> 00:11:10.417
It's better if we can split
the rental fee.

00:11:10.584 --> 00:11:11.876
Just ask him to pay
half of the rental then.

00:11:13.819 --> 00:11:15.885
I didn't say I'll agree with that!

00:11:18.106 --> 00:11:18.919
You!

00:11:19.002 --> 00:11:22.042
Do you know how many people
want to stay with Sister Mu?

00:11:22.167 --> 00:11:24.334
You should be happy since
you only need to pay half of the rental.

00:11:24.738 --> 00:11:25.351
Okay!

00:11:25.451 --> 00:11:26.745
It's decided then.

00:11:26.789 --> 00:11:28.323
I'll ask someone to move
our luggage now!

00:11:35.499 --> 00:11:36.766
Just lying here,

00:11:36.872 --> 00:11:38.591
watching some TV programmes,
surfing the Internet.

00:11:38.824 --> 00:11:40.517
What a good life!

00:11:40.957 --> 00:11:42.066
Ai Tutu!

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:45.916
Sister Mu, I know it's my fault.

00:11:46.023 --> 00:11:48.076
I thought you were curious
about he beat you?

00:11:48.334 --> 00:11:51.751
And I've heard that many girls
saw him saving them as well.

00:11:52.083 --> 00:11:54.584
He's much stronger than
those who is from a noble background.

00:11:54.904 --> 00:11:56.757
The devil has huge potential.

00:12:00.147 --> 00:12:02.762
But he's quite close to the Zhao Family.

00:12:03.319 --> 00:12:04.572
I don't think it is a good idea.

00:12:05.064 --> 00:12:06.131
Don't worry.

00:12:06.297 --> 00:12:07.870
We can know each other
better since we share a house.

00:12:07.903 --> 00:12:10.974
Maybe he'll join the Mu Family
because he admires you.

00:12:15.048 --> 00:12:16.634
Here!

00:12:18.988 --> 00:12:20.874
Just put it in the living room.

00:12:27.198 --> 00:12:28.932
Someone has already been here before us?

00:12:30.134 --> 00:12:31.387
What's going on?

00:12:32.601 --> 00:12:33.528
We're moving our stuffs.

00:12:33.588 --> 00:12:35.604
I have to put my bunny on the sofa.

00:12:36.964 --> 00:12:38.436
Okay, you guys can go now.

00:12:39.952 --> 00:12:40.659
Brother.

00:12:40.845 --> 00:12:42.069
Why are you still lying there?

00:12:42.342 --> 00:12:44.108
Didn't you hear Tutu
asking us to leave ?

00:12:44.874 --> 00:12:46.560
Friend, I live here.

00:12:47.980 --> 00:12:49.247
Stop dreaming!

00:12:49.473 --> 00:12:50.282
Leave now.

00:12:50.808 --> 00:12:52.172
It's you that should leave.

00:12:59.110 --> 00:13:00.344
They're fighting now!

00:13:00.345 --> 00:13:01.419
Fight!

00:13:02.303 --> 00:13:03.503
He's a mage of level 2.

00:13:09.268 --> 00:13:10.214
What are you guys doing?

00:13:13.216 --> 00:13:14.550
I'm Han Luo.

00:13:14.818 --> 00:13:17.711
It's my pleasure to see you here,
Miss Mu Nujiao.

00:13:18.395 --> 00:13:19.728
Sorry for offending you,

00:13:19.977 --> 00:13:21.604
but this kid is too rude!

00:13:21.644 --> 00:13:23.299
We need to teach him a lesson.

00:13:26.097 --> 00:13:27.391
He's indeed staying here.

00:13:27.413 --> 00:13:29.920
You two can leave now.
Don't cause any trouble for me.

00:13:32.896 --> 00:13:33.869
What?

00:13:35.331 --> 00:13:36.664
You okay with us sharing a house?

00:13:37.712 --> 00:13:39.586
sharing a house?

00:13:39.938 --> 00:13:40.591
You!

00:13:41.967 --> 00:13:44.040
Since that's the case, we'll leave now.

00:13:44.041 --> 00:13:45.547
It's a misunderstanding.

00:13:45.547 --> 00:13:46.407
Scum!

00:13:46.408 --> 00:13:47.678
Wait for me!

00:13:48.464 --> 00:13:49.055
Tutu.

00:13:49.115 --> 00:13:50.114
You're making mess again.

00:13:51.125 --> 00:13:53.585
Sister Mu, I did this
because I think it's fun.

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:55.214
Mo Fan.

00:13:57.364 --> 00:13:58.950
Beware of both two.

00:13:59.292 --> 00:14:01.375
They're from noble families too.
And they're strong.

00:14:01.608 --> 00:14:03.416
They may try to set you up next time.

00:14:07.375 --> 00:14:08.429
It's nothing.

00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:12.184
Life in university
is funner than I expected.

00:14:29.487 --> 00:14:30.881
Are you used to the place?

00:14:31.862 --> 00:14:32.960
I'm fine.

00:14:33.796 --> 00:14:35.767
I heard from Dad. He said
you were performing well in school.

00:14:35.768 --> 00:14:36.986
And you took many scholarships.

00:14:37.445 --> 00:14:40.452
I can't say that I'm performing well
since I've offended many people.

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:43.085
But I did take many scholarships.

00:14:43.768 --> 00:14:46.396
I'll give you a big surprise
when I've earned enough money.

00:14:47.025 --> 00:14:49.494
You, visiting me,
is a big surprise already.

00:14:57.528 --> 00:14:59.916
Xinxia, have you heard
of The White Lady before?

00:15:02.411 --> 00:15:03.376
You don't have that here?

00:15:03.554 --> 00:15:06.448
I thought our two worlds
have the same history.

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:08.667
Brother Mo Fan.

00:15:08.824 --> 00:15:10.824
I don't understand your words.

00:15:11.600 --> 00:15:12.987
Didn't I tell you already?

00:15:13.293 --> 00:15:15.046
I'm from a different world.

00:15:15.567 --> 00:15:17.874
Your world is quite different from mine.

00:15:18.314 --> 00:15:20.839
Don't try to fool me again.
I'm not a kid anymore.

00:15:22.086 --> 00:15:23.276
You don't believe me?

00:15:23.510 --> 00:15:26.248
I think nobody would believe me now.
But I'm not from this world.

00:15:36.342 --> 00:15:37.382
Brother Mo Fan.

00:15:37.529 --> 00:15:41.454
My history teacher said that the people
from Bow City are unique.

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:42.774
Why?

00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:45.941
Bow City's history can be
traced back to the early 200 A.D..

00:15:46.442 --> 00:15:50.221
Those who first lived in Bow City
were the Sacred Spring's guardians.

00:15:50.541 --> 00:15:54.573
Under the order of a king,
they've sworn to protect the Spring forever

00:15:55.452 --> 00:15:59.316
But as time went by,
and as humans spread and moved around ,

00:15:59.897 --> 00:16:01.744
Bow City became the way it is today.

00:16:02.461 --> 00:16:07.228
The so-called guardians were
also gone as time went by.

00:16:07.895 --> 00:16:11.226
Or, the entire population of
the Bow City were all guardians.

00:16:11.977 --> 00:16:15.845
So, obviously the Black Curia must
have some motives to destroy Bow City.

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:23.327
Is the crisis in Bow City
connected to its history?

00:16:24.887 --> 00:16:28.780
To know the truth, you need
to find the ancient tomb.

00:16:29.396 --> 00:16:32.129
But the spirits inside
the ancient tomb are very malicious.

00:16:32.228 --> 00:16:35.822
That's why nobody has dared to
venture into the ancient tomb so far.

00:16:36.903 --> 00:16:37.703
Ancient tomb?

00:16:38.195 --> 00:16:39.168
What tomb?

00:16:40.104 --> 00:16:42.277
The most famous resting
place of the dead.

00:16:42.587 --> 00:16:43.804
Gu Du's Tomb.

